{"id":1338,"date":"2026-03-10T14:02:14","date_gmt":"2026-03-10T21:02:14","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/shaoyiwang.com\/?page_id=1338"},"modified":"2026-04-10T16:22:52","modified_gmt":"2026-04-10T23:22:52","slug":"cs280a-proj1","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/shaoyiwang.com\/cs280a-proj1\/","title":{"rendered":"Colorizing the Prokudin-Gorskii photo collection"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><em>Note: click on the images to enlarge.<\/em><\/p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-jetpack-markdown\"><h2>Introduction<\/h2>\n<p>Sergei Mikhailovich Prokudin-Gorskii (1863\u20131944) was a pioneer of early color photography. As early as 1907, he believed that color photos would become the future of documentation.<\/p>\n<p>He developed a technique to capture three separate black-and-white images of the same scene, each through a different color filter: <strong>red<\/strong>, <strong>green<\/strong>, and <strong>blue<\/strong>. When these images are aligned and combined, they form a full-color photo.<\/p>\n<p>The glass plates were digitized and released online, giving us the chance to reconstruct full-color images using modern image processing techniques.<\/p>\n<h2>Single-scale implementation<\/h2>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">In the single-scale alignment approach, the aim is to align the red and green channels to the blue channel by minimizing the L2 distance between them. For each possible (x, y) displacement within a specified search range (from -20 to 20 pixels), I used <code>np.roll()<\/code> to shift the red channel and green channel images and then calculated the alignment quality using the <strong>L2 distance<\/strong> between the shifted image and the reference image (the blue channel image). To avoid misleading contributions from the image borders (which become invalid after shifting), I crop out the boundary pixels affected by the shift before computing the score.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The L2 score is calculated as follows::<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">$$<br>L_2 = \\sum_{(i,j) \\in \\text{Overlap}} \\left( I_1(i, j) &#8211; I_2(i, j) \\right)^2<br>$$<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Here, <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/s0.wp.com\/latex.php?latex=I_1&#038;bg=ffffff&#038;fg=000&#038;s=0&#038;c=20201002\" alt=\"I_1\" class=\"latex\" \/> is the reference image (the blue channel), and <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/s0.wp.com\/latex.php?latex=I_2&#038;bg=ffffff&#038;fg=000&#038;s=0&#038;c=20201002\" alt=\"I_2\" class=\"latex\" \/> is the shifted image (green or red channel).<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">During the search, I keep track of the best (i.e., lowest) L2 score, and update the optimal shift values accordingly. Finally, the function returns the best-shifted version of the red and green channel images with the x and y offsets and the final score.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Once the best shifts are found, I aligned the green and red channels accordingly and stack them with the blue channel to create the final color image.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-3 is-cropped wp-block-gallery-1 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"390\" height=\"341\" data-attachment-id=\"307\" data-permalink=\"https:\/\/shaoyiwang.com\/?attachment_id=307\" data-orig-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/2_aligned_cathedral.jpg?fit=390%2C341&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"390,341\" data-comments-opened=\"0\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"2_aligned_cathedral\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/2_aligned_cathedral.jpg?fit=390%2C341&amp;ssl=1\" data-id=\"307\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/2_aligned_cathedral.jpg?resize=390%2C341&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-307\" srcset=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/2_aligned_cathedral.jpg?w=390&amp;ssl=1 390w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/2_aligned_cathedral.jpg?resize=300%2C262&amp;ssl=1 300w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 390px) 100vw, 390px\" \/><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">cathedral<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"396\" height=\"341\" data-attachment-id=\"310\" data-permalink=\"https:\/\/shaoyiwang.com\/?attachment_id=310\" data-orig-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/2_aligned_tobolsk.jpg?fit=396%2C341&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"396,341\" data-comments-opened=\"0\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"2_aligned_tobolsk\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/2_aligned_tobolsk.jpg?fit=396%2C341&amp;ssl=1\" data-id=\"310\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/2_aligned_tobolsk.jpg?resize=396%2C341&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-310\" srcset=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/2_aligned_tobolsk.jpg?w=396&amp;ssl=1 396w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/2_aligned_tobolsk.jpg?resize=300%2C258&amp;ssl=1 300w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 396px) 100vw, 396px\" \/><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">tobolsk<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"401\" height=\"341\" data-attachment-id=\"311\" data-permalink=\"https:\/\/shaoyiwang.com\/?attachment_id=311\" data-orig-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/2_aligned_mosque.jpg?fit=401%2C341&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"401,341\" data-comments-opened=\"0\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"2_aligned_mosque\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/2_aligned_mosque.jpg?fit=401%2C341&amp;ssl=1\" data-id=\"311\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/2_aligned_mosque.jpg?resize=401%2C341&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-311\" srcset=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/2_aligned_mosque.jpg?w=401&amp;ssl=1 401w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/2_aligned_mosque.jpg?resize=300%2C255&amp;ssl=1 300w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 401px) 100vw, 401px\" \/><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">mosque<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"391\" height=\"341\" data-attachment-id=\"306\" data-permalink=\"https:\/\/shaoyiwang.com\/?attachment_id=306\" data-orig-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/2_aligned_monastery.jpg?fit=391%2C341&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"391,341\" data-comments-opened=\"0\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"2_aligned_monastery\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/2_aligned_monastery.jpg?fit=391%2C341&amp;ssl=1\" data-id=\"306\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/2_aligned_monastery.jpg?resize=391%2C341&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-306\" title=\"image\" srcset=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/2_aligned_monastery.jpg?w=391&amp;ssl=1 391w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/2_aligned_monastery.jpg?resize=300%2C262&amp;ssl=1 300w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 391px) 100vw, 391px\" \/><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">monastery<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"399\" height=\"341\" data-attachment-id=\"312\" data-permalink=\"https:\/\/shaoyiwang.com\/?attachment_id=312\" data-orig-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/2_aligned_Clothing.jpg?fit=399%2C341&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"399,341\" data-comments-opened=\"0\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"2_aligned_Clothing\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/2_aligned_Clothing.jpg?fit=399%2C341&amp;ssl=1\" data-id=\"312\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/2_aligned_Clothing.jpg?resize=399%2C341&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-312\" srcset=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/2_aligned_Clothing.jpg?w=399&amp;ssl=1 399w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/2_aligned_Clothing.jpg?resize=300%2C256&amp;ssl=1 300w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 399px) 100vw, 399px\" \/><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">clothing<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/figure>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-jetpack-markdown\"><p>Here we see all the small-scale images works well (including the three given images and two selected images). The moving vectors of each image channel are listed as follows:<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"><table class=\"has-fixed-layout\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\"><strong>Image name<\/strong><\/td><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\"><strong>green channel vector<\/strong><\/td><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\"><strong>red channel vector<\/strong><\/td><\/tr><tr><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\">cathedral.jpg<\/td><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\">[2, 5]<\/td><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\">[3, 12]<\/td><\/tr><tr><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\">tobolsk.jpg<\/td><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\">[3, 3]<\/td><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\">[3, 6]<\/td><\/tr><tr><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\">mosque.jpg<\/td><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\">[4, 5]<\/td><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\">[7, 13]<\/td><\/tr><tr><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\">monastery.jpg<\/td><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\">[2, -3]<\/td><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\">[2, 3]<\/td><\/tr><tr><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\">clothing.jpg<\/td><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\">[-2, 2]<\/td><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\">[-4, 12]<\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"\/>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-jetpack-markdown\"><h2>Multiscale pyramid version for large images<\/h2>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">To speed up the alignment for high-resolution images, I implemented a <strong>pyramid-based coarse-to-fine alignment<\/strong> strategy. Instead of aligning on the full-resolution images right away (which is computationally expensive), I gradually align the images from low resolution to high resolution. <\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Here\u2019s how it works:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h5 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Image pyramid construction<\/h5>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">For each level of the pyramid, I downsample all input images with a factor <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/s0.wp.com\/latex.php?latex=f&#038;bg=ffffff&#038;fg=000&#038;s=0&#038;c=20201002\" alt=\"f\" class=\"latex\" \/> to get lower-resolution images:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">$$<br>I_{\\text{low}} = I[::f,\\ ::f]<br>$$<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">where&nbsp;<img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/s0.wp.com\/latex.php?latex=f+%3D+2%5Et&#038;bg=ffffff&#038;fg=000&#038;s=0&#038;c=20201002\" alt=\"f = 2^t\" class=\"latex\" \/>&nbsp;represents the downsampling factor at level&nbsp;<img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/s0.wp.com\/latex.php?latex=t&#038;bg=ffffff&#038;fg=000&#038;s=0&#038;c=20201002\" alt=\"t\" class=\"latex\" \/>. This reduces the image size by a factor of&nbsp;<img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/s0.wp.com\/latex.php?latex=f&#038;bg=ffffff&#038;fg=000&#038;s=0&#038;c=20201002\" alt=\"f\" class=\"latex\" \/>, making alignment significantly faster at coarser levels. To determine the initial level of the image pyramid, I set the value of <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/s0.wp.com\/latex.php?latex=t&#038;bg=ffffff&#038;fg=000&#038;s=0&#038;c=20201002\" alt=\"t\" class=\"latex\" \/> dynamically based on the input image size, where <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/s0.wp.com\/latex.php?latex=h&#038;bg=ffffff&#038;fg=000&#038;s=0&#038;c=20201002\" alt=\"h\" class=\"latex\" \/> is the height of the image:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">$$<br>t = \\left\\lfloor \\log_{10}(h) \\right\\rfloor<br>$$<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h5 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Recursive Refinement<\/h5>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Starting from the coarsest level of the pyramid, I align the downsampled red and green channels to the blue channel. At each level, the estimated shift is scaled up and passed as the initial guess for the next finer level, allowing the alignment to gradually refine as the resolution increases. The shift is calculated as follows:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">$$<br>\\text{shift}_{\\text{next}} = \\text{shift}_{\\text{prev}} + \\Delta \\text{shift} \\times f<br>$$<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">where  <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/s0.wp.com\/latex.php?latex=+%5Ctext%7Bshift%7D_%7B%5Ctext%7Bnext%7D%7D+&#038;bg=ffffff&#038;fg=000&#038;s=0&#038;c=20201002\" alt=\" &#92;text{shift}_{&#92;text{next}} \" class=\"latex\" \/> is the updated cumulative shift to be used as the initial guess for the next (finer) level, <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/s0.wp.com\/latex.php?latex=%5Ctext%7Bshift%7D_%7B%5Ctext%7Bprev%7D%7D&#038;bg=ffffff&#038;fg=000&#038;s=0&#038;c=20201002\" alt=\"&#92;text{shift}_{&#92;text{prev}}\" class=\"latex\" \/> is the cumulative shift from the previous (coarser) level, and <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/s0.wp.com\/latex.php?latex=%5CDelta+%5Ctext%7Bshift%7D+&#038;bg=ffffff&#038;fg=000&#038;s=0&#038;c=20201002\" alt=\"&#92;Delta &#92;text{shift} \" class=\"latex\" \/> is the local optimal shift found at the current level. This helps ensure the final alignment is both globally accurate and locally refined.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h5 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Dynamic search window<\/h5>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">For the coarsest levels (where <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/s0.wp.com\/latex.php?latex=f+%3E+3&#038;bg=ffffff&#038;fg=000&#038;s=0&#038;c=20201002\" alt=\"f &gt; 3\" class=\"latex\" \/>), I use a larger search window of \u00b115 pixels. For finer levels, I reduce the search range to \u00b15 pixels, since we are already quite close to the optimal shift.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h5 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Final Output<\/h5>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">After refining over all pyramid levels, the function returns the best aligned version of the red and green channel image along with the total x and y shift values relative to the red channel image.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-3 is-cropped wp-block-gallery-2 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-