ed-layout\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\"><strong>Image name<\/strong><\/td><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\"><strong>green channel vector<\/strong><\/td><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\"><strong>red channel vector<\/strong><\/td><\/tr><tr><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\">cathedral.jpg<\/td><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\">[2, 5]<\/td><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\">[3, 12]<\/td><\/tr><tr><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\">tobolsk.jpg<\/td><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\">[3, 3]<\/td><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\">[3, 6]<\/td><\/tr><tr><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\">monastery.jpg<\/td><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\">[2, -3]<\/td><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\">[2, 3]<\/td><\/tr><tr><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\">church.tif<\/td><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\">[4, 26]<\/td><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\">[-4, 59]<\/td><\/tr><tr><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\">italil.tif<\/td><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\">[21, 38]<\/td><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\">[35, 76]<\/td><\/tr><tr><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\">harvesters.tif<\/td><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\">[17, 60]<\/td><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\">[13, 124]<\/td><\/tr><tr><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\">icon.tif<\/td><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\">[17, 41]<\/td><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\">[23, 90]<\/td><\/tr><tr><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\">siren.tif<\/td><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\">[-6, 50]<\/td><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\">[-25, 96]<\/td><\/tr><tr><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\">three_generations.tif<\/td><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\">[14, 53]<\/td><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\">[11, 112]<\/td><\/tr><tr><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\">lugano.tif<\/td><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\">[-16, 41]<\/td><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\">[-29, 93]<\/td><\/tr><tr><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\">melons.tif<\/td><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\">[11, 82]<\/td><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\">[14, 179]<\/td><\/tr><tr><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\">self_portrait.tif<\/td><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\">[29, 79]<\/td><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\">[37, 176]<\/td><\/tr><tr><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\">lastochikino.tif<\/td><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\">[-2, -3]<\/td><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\">[-9, 75]<\/td><\/tr><tr><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\">emir.tif<\/td><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\">[24, 49]<\/td><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\">[61, 103]<\/td><\/tr><tr><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\">cathedral.jpg<\/td><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\">[2, 5]<\/td><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\">[3, 12]<\/td><\/tr><tr><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\">tobolsk.jpg<\/td><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\">[3, 3]<\/td><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\">[3, 6]<\/td><\/tr><tr><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\">monastery.jpg<\/td><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\">[2, -3]<\/td><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\">[2, 3]<\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">This approach significantly reduces computation time compared to exhaustive full-resolution alignment, and works well for most images. Note that for the smaller jpg images, this approach has the same result as the single-scale approach. However, <strong>alignment for <code>emir.tif<\/code> is not as accurate<\/strong> compared to others, probably because the red channel contains strong contrast differences (especially in the clothing and shadows) that are not present in the green or blue channels. As a result, intensity-based alignment metrics like L2 distance or NCC may fail to find the perceptually correct alignment.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">In this cases, using edge-based features or image gradients can help, which will be presented in the bells &amp; whistles session.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"\/>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-jetpack-markdown\"><h2>Bells &amp; Whistles<\/h2>\n<h3>1. Automatic cropping<\/h3>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">To remove the low-information borders, I compute the local standard deviation along each row and column of the image. Regions with low variation are likely to be background and are cropped out.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Let the image be <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/s0.wp.com\/latex.php?latex=I&#038;bg=ffffff&#038;fg=000&#038;s=0&#038;c=20201002\" alt=\"I\" class=\"latex\" \/>, and define the row-wise and column-wise standard deviation vectors as:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">$$<br>\\sigma_{\\text{row}}(i) = \\text{std}(I[i, :]), \\sigma_{\\text{col}}(j) = \\text{std}(I[:, j])<br>$$<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">To smooth out noise, I apply a moving average filter (with window size <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/s0.wp.com\/latex.php?latex=w+%3D+0.05+%2A+Width_%7Bimage%7D&#038;bg=ffffff&#038;fg=000&#038;s=0&#038;c=20201002\" alt=\"w = 0.05 * Width_{image}\" class=\"latex\" \/>):<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">$$\\tilde{\\sigma}(i) = \\frac{1}{w} \\sum_{k = i &#8211; \\lfloor w\/2 \\rfloor}^{i + \\lfloor w\/2 \\rfloor} \\sigma(k)$$<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">I then compute a central reference value (average within the middle half), and crop all rows\/columns whose smoothed std is significantly below or above that, using a dynamic threshold based on (I reached the factor of 0.45 after some finetuning):<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">$$\\tau = 0.45 \\cdot \\min\\left( \\text{std}(I),\\ \\max(I) &#8211; \\min(I) \\right)$$<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Only rows and columns where<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">$$ \\left| \\tilde{\\sigma}(i) &#8211; \\mu \\right| &lt; \\tau$$ <\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">are kept, where <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/s0.wp.com\/latex.php?latex=%5Cmu&#038;bg=ffffff&#038;fg=000&#038;s=0&#038;c=20201002\" alt=\"&#92;mu\" class=\"latex\" \/> is the mean std in the central region (from 1\/4 to 3\/4 of the image).<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped wp-block-gallery-4 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"888\" data-attachment-id=\"376\" data-permalink=\"https:\/\/shaoyiwang.com\/?attachment_id=376\" data-orig-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/2_aligned_icon-1.jpg?fit=3741%2C3244&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"3741,3244\" data-comments-opened=\"0\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credi