amp;ssl=1\" data-id=\"395\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/3_croped_three_generations.jpg?resize=1024%2C958&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-395\" srcset=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/3_croped_three_generations.jpg?resize=1024%2C958&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/3_croped_three_generations.jpg?resize=300%2C281&amp;ssl=1 300w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/3_croped_three_generations.jpg?resize=768%2C718&amp;ssl=1 768w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/3_croped_three_generations.jpg?resize=1536%2C1437&amp;ssl=1 1536w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/3_croped_three_generations.jpg?resize=2048%2C1915&amp;ssl=1 2048w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/3_croped_three_generations.jpg?resize=1200%2C1122&amp;ssl=1 1200w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/3_croped_three_generations.jpg?w=3000&amp;ssl=1 3000w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1000px) 100vw, 1000px\" \/><\/figure>\n<\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">In each image pair, the left side shows the before, and the right side shows the after. Most images have had their borders appropriately cropped, though a few still retain some colored edges.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"\/>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-jetpack-markdown\"><h3>2. Automatic contrasting<\/h3>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">I performed a linear normalization of image pixel values, stretching them to the full 0\u2013255 range. I first find the minimum and maximum intensity in the image, then rescale all pixel values accordingly using the formula<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">$$ I_{\\text{rescaled}}(x, y) = \\left( \\frac{I(x, y) &#8211; I_{\\min}}{I_{\\max} &#8211; I_{\\min}} \\right) \\times 255$$<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">which helps standardize the intensity range for visualization and further processing.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">In the image comparison below, the left side shows the original image (before), and the right side shows the rescaled version (after). While there is a slight color shift, the difference is generally subtle. This is because many of the original images already have a broad dynamic range. For example, in the <em>Three Generations<\/em> image (the first image pair), the original intensity values already span from 1 to 246, so the rescaling has only a limited visible effect.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-6 is-cropped wp-block-gallery-8 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"958\" data-attachment-id=\"415\" data-permalink=\"https:\/\/shaoyiwang.com\/?attachment_id=415\" data-orig-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/3_croped_three_generations-1.jpg?fit=3273%2C3061&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"3273,3061\" data-comments-opened=\"0\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"3_croped_three_generations\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/3_croped_three_generations-1.jpg?fit=1024%2C958&amp;ssl=1\" data-id=\"415\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content