nts-opened=\"0\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"4_contrast_siren\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/4_contrast_siren.jpg?fit=1024%2C945&amp;ssl=1\" data-id=\"422\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/4_contrast_siren.jpg?resize=1024%2C945&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-422\" srcset=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/4_contrast_siren.jpg?resize=1024%2C945&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/4_contrast_siren.jpg?resize=300%2C277&amp;ssl=1 300w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/4_contrast_siren.jpg?resize=768%2C709&amp;ssl=1 768w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/4_contrast_siren.jpg?resize=1536%2C1418&amp;ssl=1 1536w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/4_contrast_siren.jpg?resize=2048%2C1890&amp;ssl=1 2048w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/4_contrast_siren.jpg?resize=1200%2C1108&amp;ssl=1 1200w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/4_contrast_siren.jpg?w=3000&amp;ssl=1 3000w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1000px) 100vw, 1000px\" \/><\/figure>\n<\/figure>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"\/>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-jetpack-markdown\"><h3>3. Automatic white balance<\/h3>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The gray-world white balance algorithm assumes that the average color of a natural image should be a neutral gray. To achieve this, each channel is rescaled so that its mean intensity matches the global average.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The scaling factor for each channel is defined as:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">$$ s_c = \\frac{\\frac{1}{3}\\left(R_{\\text{avg}} + G_{\\text{avg}} + B_{\\text{avg}}\\right)}{I_c^{\\text{avg}}}, \\quad c \\in {{R, G, B}} $$<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">where <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/s0.wp.com\/latex.php?latex=+R_%7B%5Ctext%7Bavg%7D%7D+&#038;bg=ffffff&#038;fg=000&#038;s=0&#038;c=20201002\" alt=\" R_{&#92;text{avg}} \" class=\"latex\" \/>, <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/s0.wp.com\/latex.php?latex=+G_%7B%5Ctext%7Bavg%7D%7D&#038;bg=ffffff&#038;fg=000&#038;s=0&#038;c=20201002\" alt=\" G_{&#92;text{avg}}\" class=\"latex\" \/>, and <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/s0.wp.com\/latex.php?latex=+B_%7B%5Ctext%7Bavg%7D%7D&#038;bg=ffffff&#038;fg=000&#038;s=0&#038;c=20201002\" alt=\" B_{&#92;text{avg}}\" class=\"latex\" \/> are the mean values of the red, green, and blue channels, and<img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/s0.wp.com\/latex.php?latex=I_c%5E%7B%5Ctext%7Bavg%7D%7D+&#038;bg=ffffff&#038;fg=000&#038;s=0&#038;c=20201002\" alt=\"I_c^{&#92;text{avg}} \" class=\"latex\" \/>is the mean of channel <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/s0.wp.com\/latex.php?latex=%5Cquad+c&#038;bg=ffffff&#038;fg=000&#038;s=0&#038;c=20201002\" alt=\"&#92;quad c\" class=\"latex\" \/>.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">In each pair of images, the left side shows the before and the right side shows the after. Some images appear closer to their true colors after adjustment, but in others where the real scene is naturally more green or blue, the same correction results in a reddish tint. Overall, images with richer color diversity in the scene benefit more from this method, while those lacking certain colors in the original scene tend to produce biased results.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped wp-block-gallery-10 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"918\" data-attachment-id=\"428\" data-permalink=\"https:\/\/shaoyiwang.com\/?attachment_id=428\" data-orig-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/4_contrast_church-1.jpg?fit=3393%2C3041&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"3393,3041\" data-comments-opened=\"0\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"4_contrast_church\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/4_contrast_church-1.jpg?fit=1024%2C918&amp;ssl=1\" data-id=\"428\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/4_contrast_church-1.jpg?resize=1024%2C918&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"church-before\" class=\"wp-image-428\" srcset=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/4_contrast_church-1.jpg?resize=1024%2C918&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/4_contrast_church-1.jpg?resize=300%2C269&amp;ssl=1 300w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/4_contrast_church-1.jpg?resize=768%2C688&amp;ssl=1 768w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/4_contrast_church-1.jpg?resize=1536%2C1377&amp;ssl=1 1536w, https:\/\/i0.wp.c