tle=\"4_contrast_tobolsk\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/4_contrast_tobolsk-1.jpg?fit=356%2C320&amp;ssl=1\" data-id=\"515\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/4_contrast_tobolsk-1.jpg?resize=356%2C320&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-515\" srcset=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/4_contrast_tobolsk-1.jpg?w=356&amp;ssl=1 356w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/4_contrast_tobolsk-1.jpg?resize=300%2C270&amp;ssl=1 300w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 356px) 100vw, 356px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"356\" height=\"320\" data-attachment-id=\"517\" data-permalink=\"https:\/\/shaoyiwang.com\/?attachment_id=517\" data-orig-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/5_white_balance_tobolsk.jpg?fit=356%2C320&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"356,320\" data-comments-opened=\"0\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"5_white_balance_tobolsk\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/5_white_balance_tobolsk.jpg?fit=356%2C320&amp;ssl=1\" data-id=\"517\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/5_white_balance_tobolsk.jpg?resize=356%2C320&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-517\" srcset=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/5_white_balance_tobolsk.jpg?w=356&amp;ssl=1 356w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/5_white_balance_tobolsk.jpg?resize=300%2C270&amp;ssl=1 300w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 356px) 100vw, 356px\" \/><\/figure>\n<\/figure>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"\/>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-jetpack-markdown\"><h3>4. Better color mapping<\/h3>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">After observing the results, I noticed that most of the images appeared bluish and somewhat dark. To address this, I designed a custom color mapping matrix <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/s0.wp.com\/latex.php?latex=M&#038;bg=ffffff&#038;fg=000&#038;s=0&#038;c=20201002\" alt=\"M\" class=\"latex\" \/> that remaps the RGB values of each pixel. The goal of this mapping is to enhance the contribution of the green and red channels while slightly reducing the influence of blue.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The transformation is applied by reshaping the image into a list of RGB vectors, multiplying each vector by <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/s0.wp.com\/latex.php?latex=M&#038;bg=ffffff&#038;fg=000&#038;s=0&#038;c=20201002\" alt=\"M\" class=\"latex\" \/>, and then reshaping it back to the original image dimensions:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">$$ I&#8217; = I \\cdot M^T $$<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">where <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/s0.wp.com\/latex.php?latex=I&#038;bg=ffffff&#038;fg=000&#038;s=0&#038;c=20201002\" alt=\"I\" class=\"latex\" \/> is the original RGB vector and <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/s0.wp.com\/latex.php?latex=I%27&#038;bg=ffffff&#038;fg=000&#038;s=0&#038;c=20201002\" alt=\"I&#039;\" class=\"latex\" \/> is the adjusted color vector. For <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/s0.wp.com\/latex.php?latex=M&#038;bg=ffffff&#038;fg=000&#038;s=0&#038;c=20201002\" alt=\"M\" class=\"latex\" \/>, I used the following matrix:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">$$M =<br>\\begin{bmatrix}<br>1.1 &amp; 0.05 &amp; 0.05 \\\\<br>0.05 &amp; 1.0 &amp; 0.05 \\\\<br>0.00 &amp; 0.00 &amp; 0.9<br>\\end{bmatrix}$$<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">In this case, the new colors are<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">$$ R&#8217; = 1.1R + 0.05G + 0.05B\\\\  G&#8217; = 0.05R + 1.0G + 0.05B\\\\  B&#8217; = 0.9B $$<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">This mapping slightly boosts red and green while lowering blue, resulting in images that look brighter and more balanced in terms of color. The result of this adjustment is that some images appear brighter and more vivid, but if the image contains a blue sky, the sky color may become slightly distorted.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped wp-block-gallery-12 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"958\" data-attachment-id=\"454\" data-permalink=\"https:\/\/shaoyiwang.com\/?attachment_id=454\" data-orig-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/4_contrast_three_generations-2.jpg?fit=3273%2C3061&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"3273,3061\" data-comments-opened=\"0\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"4_contrast_three_generations\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/4_contrast_three_generat